OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court grants injunction to
OL,4,Astop Orange Order Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast High Court has issued a
OL,7,Ftemporary injunction stopping Sunday's
OL,8,FDrumcree parade.
OL,10,FOn Friday the Parades Commission
OL,11,Fannounced that the parade could proceed
OL,12,Fon Sunday, for the first time in almost
OL,13,F30 years, with restrictions in place.
OL,15,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition,
OL,16,Fwhich mounted a legal challenge, also
OL,17,Fsaid it planned to protest with a 5,000
OL,18,Fparticipants if the parade went ahead.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
