OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court grants injunction to
OL,4,Astop Orange Order Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development came after Portadown
OL,7,FDistrict Orange Lodge declined a
OL,8,Frequest from Judge Patricia Smyth to
OL,9,Fpostpone the parade along the Garvaghy
OL,10,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
